projects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-game-design-bible.md:48:| GAME-005 | **Round “First Whistle.”** Tutorial round contains 5 fixed, original tutorial cards (`TUT-01`–`TUT-05`) covering selecting, typing, feedback, explanation, and pause/save. It is intentionally non-timed. | This is the complete first useful journey. Completion creates/updates local milestone `first_whistle_complete`; it cannot require account, network, purchase, or deferred content. Test: a new local profile can complete it offline and resume after app restart. |
